IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `vsa-consent`

-- Voluntary Sterilisation Act 1974, ss 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 8 and 10 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_voluntary-sterilisation-act-1974.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a married 30-year-old who consents` MEANS Patient WITH
