#ASSERT `the s 3(2) conditions are satisfied` `an unmarried 30-year-old lacking capacity, order on a parent's application`
#ASSERT NOT `the s 3(2) conditions are satisfied` `an unmarried 30-year-old lacking capacity, parents consent, no order`
#ASSERT `the s 3(2) conditions are satisfied` `an unmarried 16-year-old lacking capacity, order on a guardian's application`

